    <summary>Native Manifest V3 ad blocker, auto GDPR cookie rejector, AI slop filter, and browser RAM optimizer installer.</summary>
    <description>SWEEPR Deepblock Desktop Installer deploys the SWEEPR Deepblock desktop privacy utilities and Manifest V3 browser extension across Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, and Brave.

### Browser &amp; Shortcut Automation Disclosure
During installation, Setup closes running Chromium browser instances (Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, and Brave), updates user browser shortcuts to include the `--load-extension` flag pointing to `%LOCALAPPDATA%\SWEEPR\Deepblock\extension`, and relaunches the browser so the extension loads locally. Silent install supports `/S` (or `/silent`, `--silent`, `/qn`) and silent uninstall removes the extension directory and restores shortcuts via `--uninstall /S`.

### Free Utilities vs. Paid Pro Subscription
- **Included Free:** Desktop URL Tracking Parameter Cleaner, 14-point Scam Domain Audit, 253-rule MV3 Rule Inspector, and local adblock engine self-test.
- **Paid SWEEPR Deepblock Pro Subscription (`https://sweeprdeepblock.com/pricing`):** Active in-browser ad and YouTube ad blocking, `&lt;50ms` automatic GDPR/CCPA cookie consent rejection, search AI-slop cleansing, fake shop real-time alerts, and Total Tab &amp; RAM Tamer background tab hibernation require an active paid license key.

### VirusTotal Warning Notice
`SWEEPRDeepblockSetup.exe` is compiled directly from public C# source code (`https://github.com/BenCook1996/sweepr-deepblock/blob/main/installer/SWEEPRDeepblockSetup.cs`; documentation at `https://sweeprdeepblock.com/support`). Some heuristic/ML antivirus engines on VirusTotal may flag the binary at Warning level solely due to its automated browser process termination and `.lnk` shortcut modification behavior.</description>
    <releaseNotes>v1.3.0 ships the self-contained Windows desktop privacy suite with embedded offline MV3 extension package (253 C++ rules), standalone URL tracking cleaner, 14-point scam domain scanner, in-popup slide-over Settings &amp; Tabs menu, and streamlined welcome activation experience.</releaseNotes>
